## Core Philosophy of Unresitricted(U/R) Browser 
1.Unrestricted Browser U/R for short is a Non-Chromium Browser.
2.U/R is set to run as an Open-Source Browser.
3.U/R Will be made available only via Github and Nodejs.
4.U/R stands as a part of ZTL (Zeo Thinking Labs) Foundation.
5.U/R is the Project of First Experiment - 
a.Human vs AI Writing an Autonomous Non-Chromium browser focused on Cybersecurity.
6.It will be made available in WSL,Windows,GNU-Linux and Black-Arch Linux(Most Optimised for)
7.Module Test is the Module that runs tests for any Syntax 
or structural Errors.
